{
  "slug": "appwrite",
  "name": "Appwrite",
  "type": "plugin",
  "description": "Appwrite tools for Claude Code, including SDK skills, Appwrite MCP servers, and deployment commands.",
  "longDescription": "Ships **11 skills**, **2 commands** and **1 MCP server**.\n\n- **Skills** (11): `cli` (Appwrite CLI skill), `dart` (Appwrite Dart SDK skill), `dotnet` (Appwrite .NET SDK skill), `go` (Appwrite Go SDK skill), `kotlin` (Appwrite Kotlin SDK skill), `php` (Appwrite PHP SDK skill), `python` (Appwrite Python SDK skill), `ruby` (Appwrite Ruby SDK skill), and 3 more\n- **Commands** (2): `deploy-function` (Deploy a function using the Appwrite CLI), `deploy-site` (Deploy a site using the Appwrite CLI)\n- **MCP servers** (1): `appwrite`\n\nInstalls with `claude plugin install appwrite@claude-plugins-official` from `appwrite/claude-plugin`.",
